<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Cone Mills downgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Cone Mills downgraded.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>J.P. Morgan Securities said analyst Carol Pope downgraded Cone Mills Corp to market performer from long-term buy, citing prolonged weakness in the company's denim and home fashion businesses.</p>
<p>-- earlier Cone Mills said that business conditions in the second half of 1997 may not improve as it had expected, and its second quarter results should be in the lower range of analysts' estimates.</p>
<p>-- the stock was off one at 8-3/8.</p>
</text>
